controls_recenter = Hold the PICO button to recenter your view.
playspace_title = Your playspace
playspace_new = SteamVR asks you to set up your playspace when you start a game in a new room.
playspace_later = You can set it up any time in SteamVR's dashboard, under Space Setup.
